WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:10.270
Brought to you by Guodong Subs

00:00:10.560 --> 00:00:13.360
We do not own the copyright. Only for academic exchange purpose.
Welcome to watch it on the official channel

00:00:19.760 --> 00:00:24.860
Pass through boundaries of life and death, stride over the peak of the sky

00:00:24.860 --> 00:00:32.060
Look at this dim dark sky from the distance

00:00:38.730 --> 00:00:42.190
Glowing tears on fair skin

00:00:42.930 --> 00:00:47.930
Melt this dark night

00:00:48.390 --> 00:00:52.730
Souls entwine both on watch

00:00:52.930 --> 00:00:58.460
Protect the candle-like warmth

00:00:59.190 --> 00:01:03.700
Under the night sky sunflowers are swaying in the wind

00:01:04.060 --> 00:01:06.390
As the night will always pass by

00:01:06.390 --> 00:01:11.260
Let's embrace the new dawn

00:01:12.590 --> 00:01:14.990
Fleeting Meteor

00:01:14.990 --> 00:01:18.300
Broke the silence of the sky

00:01:18.300 --> 00:01:22.730
Call for new heroes with my remaining brightness

00:01:22.730 --> 00:01:25.260
Burn out the flame of life in the wind

00:01:25.260 --> 00:01:27.590
Penetrate the endless horizon

00:01:27.590 --> 00:01:29.930
Cross over the long night to another end

00:01:29.930 --> 00:01:32.990
Search for that destination

00:01:32.990 --> 00:01:35.660
Fly towards the other side of my dream

00:01:40.160 --> 00:01:42.360
Episode 13

00:01:43.260 --> 00:01:47.400
It seems you can be injured even at Core Formation level, I thought you were invulnerable.

00:01:47.860 --> 00:01:49.330
What is that dagger?

00:01:49.730 --> 00:01:51.260
This weapon

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:53.400
is called the dog killing dagger

00:01:53.400 --> 00:01:54.930
it professionally kills dogs like you

00:01:57.530 --> 00:01:58.530
Fool

00:02:03.330 --> 00:02:04.060
This is…

00:02:16.400 --> 00:02:18.600
Monster, you seem to be quite fast

00:02:19.460 --> 00:02:23.130
I almost fell for your trap

00:02:26.400 --> 00:02:28.330
It’s the dragon blood’s feature

00:02:29.330 --> 00:02:33.260
These bodies, I can't tell which is real even though I have such a good cultivation base

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:36.100
It’s awesome right?

00:02:36.100 --> 00:02:36.130
I think it's awesome too
It’s awesome right?

00:02:36.130 --> 00:02:37.160
I think it's awesome too

00:02:37.160 --> 00:02:38.430
Do you know which is the real me?

00:02:38.460 --> 00:02:41.130
Body Separation cannot be maintain for a long time

00:02:41.130 --> 00:02:43.060
It will disappear after two hours

00:02:43.400 --> 00:02:48.330
Master’s spirit energy can also create no more than two bodies

00:02:51.060 --> 00:02:52.530
I think that's right

00:02:52.530 --> 00:02:56.060
But I found that there’s also a special use

00:02:56.730 --> 00:02:57.800
What is it?

00:02:58.530 --> 00:03:02.930
I can transfer my soul between the bodies

00:03:05.600 --> 00:03:09.660
You mean that you can freely switch between those bodies?

00:03:09.660 --> 00:03:11.330
If you can move from body to body

00:03:11.330 --> 00:03:14.400
You can avoid fatal injuries when you are in danger

00:03:14.800 --> 00:03:16.000
and also confuse the enemy

00:03:16.730 --> 00:03:17.730
That’s right

00:03:18.130 --> 00:03:21.600
We need to rely on the dagger's special ability to fight against that monster

00:03:23.400 --> 00:03:28.000
I can see that your Body Separation must be the skill of that dagger

00:03:28.130 --> 00:03:30.060
How bright of you

00:03:30.060 --> 00:03:36.200
You're pretending to be relaxed, so I make the first hit and you can hurt me again, right?

00:03:36.200 --> 00:03:38.600
A good scheme

00:03:40.000 --> 00:03:41.330
Too bad it didn't work

00:03:41.800 --> 00:03:43.800
You have no chance now

00:03:44.330 --> 00:03:48.800
Now let me show you my Fiend Art

00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:49.600
Oh no

00:03:49.930 --> 00:03:50.400
No

00:03:59.060 --> 00:04:00.860
Our spirit energy is being sucked away

00:04:01.730 --> 00:04:05.600
I didn’t expect his Fiend Art to be this powerful

00:04:09.000 --> 00:04:11.000
It also dries your blood

00:04:17.260 --> 00:04:18.660
Is this the end?

00:04:20.330 --> 00:04:21.460
Ling Er

00:04:26.130 --> 00:04:27.530
I shall obey my master’s conjuring

00:04:31.530 --> 00:04:33.060
Who are you?

00:04:34.060 --> 00:04:36.060
You're not qualified enough to ask

00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:41.130
Leave here immediately or I will kill you

00:04:46.860 --> 00:04:48.200
Master, leave here now

00:04:48.660 --> 00:04:51.460
I can only hold him for two hours at most

00:04:52.860 --> 00:04:55.860
Ling Er, you

00:04:55.860 --> 00:05:00.860
I even can’t identify her cultivation base

00:05:00.860 --> 00:05:03.060
Could it be… no

00:05:03.600 --> 00:05:05.530
Even though she has a high cultivation base

00:05:05.800 --> 00:05:07.530
If she was able to attack

00:05:07.800 --> 00:05:09.400
She wouldn't wait this long

00:05:12.600 --> 00:05:14.730
I don’t know who you are

00:05:15.060 --> 00:05:18.330
But I know there must be some limitation keeping you from attacking me

00:05:18.460 --> 00:05:21.000
Do you want to die? I’ll show you the way

00:05:28.460 --> 00:05:29.660
Could she…

00:05:34.460 --> 00:05:37.130
Have the tides churned in our favor?

00:05:44.660 --> 00:05:46.370
Indeed, just as I thought

00:05:46.370 --> 00:05:48.510
No one can leave!

00:05:50.570 --> 00:05:51.770
Muzi, Ruyue, leave now

00:05:52.370 --> 00:05:54.240
I’ll hold him here with Ling Er for a while

00:05:54.570 --> 00:05:59.110
Master, you go with them, I can deal with him alone

00:05:59.110 --> 00:06:02.710
No way, Yingxiong, I won’t leave, even if we die here we'll just die together

00:06:03.840 --> 00:06:06.640
We need to think of a strategy while he's trapped there

00:06:10.970 --> 00:06:14.970
Your spirit energy is so powerful, yet you still don't attack me?

00:06:14.970 --> 00:06:20.970
So you…I see, you called him master just now

00:06:20.970 --> 00:06:23.840
You must be a weapon spirit or something similar

00:06:23.840 --> 00:06:26.170
No wonder you can’t attack

00:06:26.370 --> 00:06:28.310
He knows everything

00:06:28.710 --> 00:06:29.910
We need to get out of here

00:06:30.310 --> 00:06:31.310
While she can still stop him

00:06:31.310 --> 00:06:33.440
We can think up another plan later

00:06:34.910 --> 00:06:37.440
Yingxiong, Ruyue is right

00:06:37.440 --> 00:06:39.370
We can’t defeat him now

00:06:39.970 --> 00:06:43.370
Ling Er has such a high cultivation base, she won't have a problem stopping that monster

00:06:43.370 --> 00:06:45.640
We'll have enough time to start the Array

00:06:46.910 --> 00:06:47.570
Then

00:06:47.840 --> 00:06:51.510
Ling Er, come back after you hold him here for a little while, we'll leave first

00:06:51.510 --> 00:06:52.910
No problem, master

00:06:53.710 --> 00:06:54.770
Damn it

00:06:55.170 --> 00:06:57.170
You can’t escape

00:07:09.570 --> 00:07:13.510
Ling Er is back, but I’ve almost run out of spirit energy

00:07:14.110 --> 00:07:16.710
That monster must have used a lot of spirit energy as well

00:07:16.710 --> 00:07:19.770
He definitely thinks we have nowhere to escape to

00:07:21.110 --> 00:07:25.310
In his condition, he won’t know we've placed a trap

00:07:32.170 --> 00:07:34.440
Why did you stop running?

00:07:35.110 --> 00:07:38.110
Are you going to make your last stand?

00:07:39.710 --> 00:07:40.510
How naïve

00:07:45.570 --> 00:07:46.570
Yang Flame Array

00:07:47.310 --> 00:07:48.110
Start-up

00:07:56.040 --> 00:07:58.570
What is this? Is this…

00:08:00.040 --> 00:08:03.040
We trapped him, attack now

00:08:03.240 --> 00:08:05.970
Hey, monster, taste my flame fist

00:08:06.110 --> 00:08:07.040
You

00:08:07.570 --> 00:08:09.770
You didn’t expect this, did you?

00:08:12.640 --> 00:08:13.840
Li fire

00:08:18.840 --> 00:08:20.510
You fools

00:08:24.640 --> 00:08:25.370
Yingxiong

00:08:32.110 --> 00:08:34.710
Why did The Yang Flame Array have no effect on you?

00:08:37.910 --> 00:08:42.240
Ruyue, you secretly read my Fiend Art book

00:08:42.570 --> 00:08:44.710
All the weakness of my Fiend Art that are recorded in that book

00:08:45.310 --> 00:08:47.440
are fake

00:09:14.570 --> 00:09:15.040
If

00:09:15.570 --> 00:09:19.640
If that's true, the record saying Fiend Art fears yang things

00:09:19.640 --> 00:09:22.840
was my trap for you

00:09:23.110 --> 00:09:26.440
The Yang Flame Array didn’t weaken him, instead it made him stronger

00:09:26.440 --> 00:09:27.370
That’s right

00:09:27.370 --> 00:09:31.840
Such Arrays containing yang don’t weaken me

00:09:32.040 --> 00:09:35.840
but instead make my Fiend Art many times stronger

00:09:36.440 --> 00:09:39.240
If my acting wasn't this great

00:09:39.510 --> 00:09:44.570
Then how would I hide in people and eat them without ever being realized

00:09:45.170 --> 00:09:48.370
I wrote the fake weakness in that book

00:09:48.770 --> 00:09:53.710
Its purpose was to trick you into using this
Array to improve the power of my Fiend Art

00:09:53.770 --> 00:09:57.640
So that I can kill you all here

00:09:58.240 --> 00:10:00.510
And then take your spirit energy

00:10:01.040 --> 00:10:04.110
to reach the Late-Stage of Core Formation

00:10:08.370 --> 00:10:09.040
Run

00:10:16.240 --> 00:10:20.240
Trying to escape? No way

00:10:25.170 --> 00:10:27.170
Since I’m here, I won’t let you hurt my master

00:10:30.770 --> 00:10:33.310
Again, you damn weapon spirit

00:10:37.910 --> 00:10:43.170
Damn it, She’s blocking my way, my food will escape soon

00:10:43.170 --> 00:10:45.510
It seems there's only one thing I can do…

00:10:46.710 --> 00:10:49.370
My dear Ruyue

00:10:55.040 --> 00:10:56.110
Old devil

00:10:57.910 --> 00:11:00.840
Don’t stop, he wants to move you with your kinship

00:11:01.110 --> 00:11:02.970
Take it easy, i'm not a child

00:11:06.910 --> 00:11:12.170
Actually for many years, I've wanted to tell you a secret

00:11:12.910 --> 00:11:14.040
About

00:11:14.510 --> 00:11:18.040
the truth of the slaughtering of your village

00:11:23.640 --> 00:11:24.640
What?

00:11:40.410 --> 00:11:45.810
Mountain breeze sends words from the distance

00:11:45.810 --> 00:11:51.210
Reverberate in the village,in the silent moon night

00:11:52.410 --> 00:11:57.810
Want to give ear to listen but out of reach

00:11:58.060 --> 00:12:03.520
Push aside clouds one by one,stars congeal into
glittering and translucent water-drop

00:12:04.520 --> 00:12:09.920
Girl's voice passes through the overlapping forests

00:12:09.990 --> 00:12:16.520
Take branch by hand to frolic,
go and find out how many secrets hidden in the cave

00:12:16.520 --> 00:12:21.920
Rithe reflected the silhouette of snuggling up to each other

00:12:22.120 --> 00:12:27.790
Wish you can be like that moon,and I,will be stars in the sky

00:12:27.790 --> 00:12:34.520
Enhance each other's bright at every restlessly night

00:12:37.190 --> 00:12:42.590
Mountain breeze took girl's somniloquy away

00:12:42.850 --> 00:12:48.250
Dissipation of cloud and mist,wipe out solidified dew drop

00:12:49.390 --> 00:12:54.790
The light get through the forest,light up the footprint

00:12:55.120 --> 00:13:00.520
The moonlight covered the boundless road
and can accompany with you again
